@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/pop-price-system-service
@provider = AWS
@serviceCode = AmazonEKS
@regionCode = us-east-1
@estimateId = replace-with-created-estimate-id
@itemId = replace-with-created-item-id
@rateId = replace-with-real-catalog-rate-id
@synchronizationId = replace-with-returned-synchronization-id
@calculationId = replace-with-returned-calculation-id

### Installed providers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/providers

### Discover Service Codes (remote AWS call)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/providers/{{provider}}/discovery

### Discover service attributes and available commercial regions
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/providers/{{provider}}/discovery?service={{serviceCode}}

### Persisted regions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/providers/{{provider}}/regions

### Persisted services (use nextAfter as after on subsequent pages)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog/services?provider={{provider}}&size=50

### Remote Query API verification, one page (follow nextToken explicitly)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/providers/{{provider}}/source-products?service={{serviceCode}}&region={{regionCode}}

### Synchronous import. Use a new key for a new request or another scope.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/synchronizations
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: eks-us-east-1-import-001

{"provider":"{{provider}}","serviceCode":"{{serviceCode}}","regionCode":"{{regionCode}}"}

### Synchronization audit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/synchronizations/{{synchronizationId}}

### Latest audit records
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/synchronizations?size=20&offset=0

### Retry FAILED execution synchronously (new audit id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/synchronizations/{{synchronizationId}}/retry

### Products (filters use exact values discovered from the source)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog/products?provider={{provider}}&service={{serviceCode}}&region={{regionCode}}&size=50

### On-Demand rates. Copy a real id and its billing unit into an estimate.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog/rates?provider={{provider}}&service={{serviceCode}}&region={{regionCode}}&modality=OnDemand&sort=asc&size=50

### Specific quotation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog/rates/{{rateId}}

### Historic versions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog/rates/{{rateId}}/history?sort=desc&size=50

### Changes, including deactivations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog/changes?provider={{provider}}&service={{serviceCode}}&sort=desc

### Create architecture with explicit monthly hours
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/estimates
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Plataforma de observabilidade","hoursPerMonth":720}

### Add component; choose a real hourly rate, with compatible attributes
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/estimates/{{estimateId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name":"Componente com cobrança horária",
  "category":"compute",
  "accountCode":"plataforma",
  "rateId":{{rateId}},
  "quantity":2,
  "consumption":1,
  "consumptionUnit":"Hrs",
  "period":"HOUR"
}

### A component with no reliable quote is preserved and returned UNPRICEABLE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/estimates/{{estimateId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Consumo sem preço selecionado","category":"logs","accountCode":"plataforma","quantity":1,"consumption":100,"consumptionUnit":"GB","period":"MONTH"}

### Private EC2 transfer in the same physical AZ: account boundary alone has no surcharge
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/estimates/{{estimateId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name":"EC2 privado na mesma AZ física",
  "category":"network",
  "accountCode":"conta-a",
  "quantity":1,
  "consumption":100,
  "consumptionUnit":"GB",
  "period":"MONTH",
  "flow":{
    "trafficKey":"telemetry-a-b",
    "sourceService":"AmazonEC2","destinationService":"AmazonEC2",
    "sourceAccount":"conta-a","destinationAccount":"conta-b",
    "sourceRegion":"us-east-1","destinationRegion":"us-east-1",
    "sourceAz":"use1-az1","destinationAz":"use1-az1",
    "direction":"INTERNAL","connectivity":"DIRECT",
    "charges":[],"intermediaries":[]
  }
}

### Calculate: complete=false and consolidated costs=null if any price or rule is missing
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/estimates/{{estimateId}}/calculate

### Composition and last persisted snapshot
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/estimates/{{estimateId}}

### Immutable calculation by identifier
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/estimates/{{estimateId}}/calculations/{{calculationId}}

### Remove item (calculation history is retained)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/estimates/{{estimateId}}/items/{{itemId}}

### List estimates
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/estimates?size=20&offset=0

### Expected 400: page size outside 1..200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog/services?size=0
X-Correlation-ID: exemplo-erro-paginacao

### Expected 400: malformed JSON in attributes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog/products?attributes=%7B
X-Correlation-ID: exemplo-erro-atributos

### Expected 400: invalid estimate UUID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/estimates/uuid-invalido
X-Correlation-ID: exemplo-erro-uuid

### Expected 400: empty name; response includes violations for the request body
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/estimates
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: exemplo-erro-validacao

{"name":"","hoursPerMonth":720}

### Expected 400: provider has no installed integration (no AWS call)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/providers/OUTRO/discovery
X-Correlation-ID: exemplo-erro-provedor
